    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>InscriptionTransitionToLimitControl2_5</name>
      <id>59</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Important. The &quot;By budgeting data 2.4&quot; limit control is outdated and will be removed in version 2.6.1. Please switch to the &quot;By budgeting data 2.5&quot; limit control</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>مهم. کنترل سقف «بر اساس داده‌های بودجه‌بندی 2.4» منسوخ است و در نسخه 2.6.1 حذف خواهد شد. لطفاً به کنترل سقف «بر اساس داده‌های بودجه‌بندی 2.5» منتقل شوید</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Внимание! Контроль лимитов &quot;По данным бюджетирования 2.4&quot; устарел и будет удален в версии 2.6.1. Пожалуйста, перейдите на контроль лимитов &quot;По данным бюджетирования 2.5&quot;</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Dikkat! &quot;Bütçeleme 2.4 verilerine göre&quot; limit kontrolü eskimiştir ve 2.6.1 sürümünde kaldırılacaktır. Lütfen &quot;Bütçeleme 2.5 verilerine göre&quot; limit kontrolüne geçiş yapın.</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Chú ý! Kiểm soát hạn mức &quot;Theo dữ liệu lập ngân sách 2.4&quot; đã cũ và sẽ bị xóa trong phiên bản 2.6.1. Vui lòng chuyển đến kiểm soát hạn mức &quot;Theo dữ liệu lập ngân sách 2.5&quot;</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Important. The &quot;By budgeting data 2.4&quot; limit control is outdated and will be removed in version 2.6.1. Please switch to the &quot;By budgeting data 2.5&quot; limit control</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Important. The &quot;By budgeting data 2.4&quot; limit control is outdated and will be removed in version 2.6.1. Please switch to the &quot;By budgeting data 2.5&quot; limit control</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <extendedTooltip>
        <name>InscriptionTransitionToLimitControl2_5ExtendedTooltip</name>
        <id>61</id>
        <type>Label</type>
        <autoMaxWidth>true</autoMaxWidth>
        <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
        <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
          <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
        </extInfo>
      </extendedTooltip>
      <contextMenu>
        <name>InscriptionTransitionToLimitControl2_5ContextMenu</name>
        <id>60</id>
        <autoFill>true</autoFill>
      </contextMenu>
      <type>Label</type>
      <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
      <textColor xsi:type="core:ColorRef">
        <color>Style.OverdueDataColor</color>
      </textColor>
      <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
        <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
      </extInfo>
    </items>
